@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+AthenaEngine v0.6.4.1.1 — Live Evidence Fallback Routing Hotfix
+================================================================
+
+Scope
+-----
+This hotfix repairs the Scout live/current-news integration seam. The live-event
+route previously returned its legacy no-match response before the v0.6.4.1.0
+Adaptive Investigation Runtime could select same-entity fallback evidence.
+
+Behavior
+--------
+- Matching live evidence remains preferred.
+- When no matching live item exists, Scout delegates fallback selection to the
+  existing Investigation evidence fallback contract.
+- Fallback evidence must match the canonical requested entity.
+- Unrelated live/test/sample evidence is never substituted.
+- Fallback freshness is explicit; undated seed context is explicitly not
+  presented as current news.
+- News/update output remains concise and exposes a discovery path.
+- Rich player/team/comparison composition paths are unchanged.
+
+Focused checks
+--------------
+python -B Tests/validate_adaptive_investigation_runtime.py
+python -B Tests/validate_live_evidence_fallback_routing.py
+python -B Tools/doctor_adaptive_investigation_runtime.py
+python -B Tools/doctor_live_evidence_fallback_routing.py
+
+Primary acceptance prompt
+-------------------------
+Recent Maple Leafs news
+
